                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Bowen.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-12-27"><hi rendition="#italic">December 27,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay communicates to Mr. Bowen the German<anchor n="a" xml:id="d829-f1"/> and
                        British<anchor n="b" xml:id="d829-f2"/> propositions in regard to
                    preliminary conditions of arbitration.)</p>
            </div>
